opencl: Bridge the missing OpenCL 2.x clone, property, timer and pipe functions.

clCloneKernel, clCreateCommandQueueWithProperties,
clCreateSamplerWithProperties, clCreateProgramWithIL, clCreatePipe,
clGetPipeInfo, clGetKernelSubGroupInfo, clGetDeviceAndHostTimer,
clGetHostTimer and clSetDefaultDeviceCommandQueue were not exported, so
an application that imports them failed to load. All are host
passthroughs without callbacks; their unix call slots are appended so
nothing is renumbered. A function the driver does not support now
reports the driver's error instead of a missing import.

From the Affinity-Wine-Builder 11.18 set (its 0067).
